OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm trying to do a tattoo of
OL,4,Aevery British bird'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie Sullivan has been a tattoo
OL,7,Fartist for 10 years and birds have
OL,8,Falways been the biggest inspiration for
OL,9,Fhis artwork.
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old, who works at the
OL,12,FGolden Goose tattoo studio in
OL,13,FBirmingham, said he had been drawing
OL,14,Fsince he was a child and had always
OL,15,Fbeen obsessed with bird watching.
OL,17,FThis love has led him to embark on a
OL,18,Fchallenge to complete tattoos featuring
OL,19,Fevery single bird native to Britain.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
