OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm trying to do a tattoo of
OL,4,Aevery British bird'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo far, he has tattooed 86 different
OL,7,Fspecies, from the UK's smallest bird,
OL,8,Fthe goldcrest, to its largest, the
OL,9,Fwhite-tailed eagle.
